{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"2919","title":" Statement ","desc":"Xiaomi is a consumer electronics company, offering products solely for civilian and commercial use.","view_cnt":"14582","like_cnt":"17","add_time":"1681460138","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/714_operatorx_operatorx_opx/14/01/2022/cfcf77f1a82961b2914f9f2d38bc9683.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a consumer electronics company, offering products solely for civilian and commercial use. We believe that every consumer in the world has the right to access communication tools and information on the internet. We have consumer businesses in more than 100 countries and regions, and adhere to all laws and regulations in every jurisdiction where we operate.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe are strongly against the accusation from the Ukrainian National Agency on Corruption Prevention (NACP) that we are \"International sponsor of war\". We don't support any war actions. We fully embrace world peace. Our mission is to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technologies.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"7203","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1681459471"},"common":null}